          "noteId": 0
        },
        {
          "no": 1,
          "type": "RESERVATION",
          "note": "The Lead customer called trough to amend his holiday as has sadly been made redundant.\nHe wished to amend to the below\n\n15/02/2026\nLHR-BGI ECON CLASSIC BOTH WAYS\nSUGAR BAY 1 X DELUXE OCEAN FRONT ROOM\nALL INCLUSIVE\n\nNEW TOTAL COST \u00A315\u0027127.04\n\nADDITIONAL \u00A32144.43\n\nI DID NOT CHARGE AN ADMON FEE AS COST OF HOLIDAY HAS GONE UP SUGNIFICANTLY BUT ADVISED ONLY ONE DATE CHANGE ALLOWS AND CUSTOMER AWARE OF THIS\nTHE CUSTOMER WISHED TO CONFIRM\nFULL ITINERARY RE-CAPPED.",
          "displayName": "Emma Kilbey",
          "dateModified": "2024-11-21T14:08:20",
          "systemGenerated": false,
          "key": "RS~1",
          "noteId": 0
        }
      ],
      "advNotes": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "code": "Travel Insurance - comprehensive - all bookings",
          "description": "Travel Insurance - comprehensive - all bookings",
          "note": "We strongly recommend customers purchase Travel Insurance IMMEDIATELY to \nensure they are adequately covered should they need to cancel or postpone their\nholiday.  Travel insurance can be purchased with us via our website, please visit \nhttps://www.virginholidays.co.uk/travel-extras/travel-insurance",
          "dateModified": "2024-12-31T10:42:15",
