          "code": "Caribbean - Transfers 2016 onwards - sales info",
          "description": "Caribbean - Transfers 2016 onwards - sales info",
          "note": "Please note:  Any passengers not arriving on a Virgin Atlantic flight MUST book a \nprivate transfer.  Seat In Coach transfers are only available when flying with Virgin\nAtlantic.",
