          "code": "Caribbean Hotels - room allocation - sales/retail info",
          "description": "Caribbean Hotels - room allocation - sales/retail info",
          "note": "If booking more than one room at a Caribbean hotel please add clear notes in \nTbox to advise who will be in each room.  The hotel will not confirm the booking \nunless they have this information.",
